{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:52 2026-08-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:52 2026-08-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:52 2026-08-28 HKT</p><p>今（28日）晨10時35分，一輛密斗貨車駛進貨櫃碼頭南路二號迴旋處期間，車頭突然起火，司機棄車逃生，車頭迅即陷入火海，消防接報到場開喉灌救，事件中無人受傷。</p><p></p><img alt=\"貨車陷入火海。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13810f9eef59870daa55c8844475454e/2026-08/01_3_25.jpg\"/><img alt=\"貨車陷入火海。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b5fa040d0b3e42ef23f9ecd0d0eadc0/2026-08/02_4_32.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防將火撲熄。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bdcaf40b98a0daa54ed763121f49dd2f/2026-08/03_5_24.jpg\"/><img alt=\"貨車陷入火海。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26b2d80279dd3735a9ed4eee4bea4e60/2026-08/04_7_21.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防將火撲熄。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d032ce814303ef568f5a3b0385b16a2/2026-08/05_5_22.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防將火撲熄。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f1a28a6d25cf1822f0b6f55557e3c30/2026-08/06_3_30.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n<p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T04:21:10.584847+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}